  "behavior": [
    "Only classified local native recycle failure offers a second dialog; validation, drafts, pending outcomes and cleanup/refresh errors do not.",
    "Cancel initially receives focus; Escape/close preserves targets. The ordinary no-warning setting cannot bypass permanent confirmation.",
    "The file service snapshots workspace generation and entry identities before confirmation and revalidates them in a single-use request.",
    "Both removal modes share exclusion, deduplication, boundary checks, draft protection, completed paths, editor cleanup and directory refresh.",
    "Permanent deletion awaits fs.promises.rm with maxRetries 3 and retryDelay 100; nested junction targets are preserved. Partial failures explicitly warn about irreversible partial deletion.",
    "Git and remote provider behavior is unchanged; no system policy or host ASAR modification."
  ],
